cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. All data and results are synthetic; conclusions hold only within the predefined simulation scenarios."
title: "Community Pharmacy Access and Supply Resilience Simulator: equitable essential-medicine access under compound public-health disruptions (synthetic simulation)"
abstract: >-
  Daily discrete simulation of a synthetic warehouse-to-community-pharmacy network with
  inventory-position replenishment, backorders and capacity constraints, and the ERRRA
  heuristic (Equity-constrained Resilient Rolling-horizon Allocation). Includes a frozen
  scenario matrix, common-random-number experiments, ablation, LHS sensitivity, stress tests
  and validation tests. Synthetic data only; not for clinical or operational use.
type: software
authors:
